WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.120
- Well, Tim, in 1883,
Faith plays your wife.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:04.380
So that must have been a stretch.

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.456
And Isabel plays your daughter.

00:00:06.456 --> 00:00:08.940
Does she fit in, right
in with your family?

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.070
I feel like literally
I'm looking at a girl

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:12.520
that could have come from y'all. So.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:13.590
(audience laughs)

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:15.420
- When we first saw Izzy, when we walked,

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:16.770
at the first day at cowboy camp,

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:19.530
when we walked in, I mean, of
course she's just beautiful,

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
and sweet, and so poised, and so mature.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.870
But when we first saw her, we went,

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:25.837
right away, we thought,

00:00:25.837 --> 00:00:29.160
"My gosh, she looks like
she could be our daughter."

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:30.810
I mean, it was just perfect casting.

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:33.270
And then, and the more we got to know her,

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:36.960
the sweeter she got, and the
more we grew to love her,

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.280
and respected her.

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:40.360
And she's just a,

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:42.690
she's incredible.

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:44.430
She just shines in this show,

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:47.490
and anybody who knows her
and was around her on set,

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:50.850
knows that she shines in
person as well in real life.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:51.683
- [Kelly] Oh that's so...

00:00:51.683 --> 00:00:52.538
- I miss you Tim.

00:00:52.538 --> 00:00:53.587
- That's so sweet.

00:00:53.587 --> 00:00:54.783
(audience applauds)

00:00:54.783 --> 00:00:56.520
What I have to ask, like, what is,

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:58.590
first of all, we're gonna
get back to cowboy camp.

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:00.060
That sounds like City Slickers, the movie,

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.016
and I'm very excited about it.

00:01:01.016 --> 00:01:01.849
(Izzy laughs)

00:01:01.849 --> 00:01:03.600
I love that film, all of them,

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:05.790
but what was it like having Tim and Faith

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:07.260
as parents in a show?

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:08.093
That's crazy.

00:01:08.093 --> 00:01:09.600
- I'm, yeah.
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:10.433
- Kind of incredible.

00:01:10.433 --> 00:01:12.450
I mean, Tim knows this already,

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:14.010
so this isn't a big shock to him,

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:15.467
but I didn't know who they were.

00:01:15.467 --> 00:01:16.451
- Wait, what?

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:18.630
- Yes. I didn't know that they were big.

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:20.336
- What rock did you live under?

00:01:20.336 --> 00:01:21.720
Why? What?

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:22.553
- [Isabel] I know.

00:01:22.553 --> 00:01:24.540
- You're young. I guess you're like 21?

00:01:24.540 --> 00:01:26.970
- Yes. But my, like my,
I just, I don't know.

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:27.803
I hide away.

00:01:27.803 --> 00:01:28.636
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:01:28.636 --> 00:01:29.469
- [Isabel] I'm a hermit.

00:01:29.469 --> 00:01:30.302
- You're so lucky though.

00:01:30.302 --> 00:01:31.688
You have all this music
to catch up on. Okay.

00:01:31.688 --> 00:01:32.521
- [Isabel] I know.
- Yes.

00:01:32.521 --> 00:01:33.354
- And I'm very excited to,

00:01:33.354 --> 00:01:35.280
but to me, I just got to get to know them

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:38.220
as just human, they're just,
you know, human beings.

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:39.750
So there was a blank slate

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:42.960
and, my goodness, are they
just the loveliest people

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:43.793
I think I've ever met.

00:01:43.793 --> 00:01:45.510
I immediately fell in love with them.

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:47.400
And it was so genuine.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:50.400
And, I mean, Faith Hill is
one of the kindest people

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:53.010
I think I've ever met in my
life, and she's a goofball.

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:53.843
- [Kelly] And she's funny.

00:01:53.843 --> 00:01:55.650
- She's such a goofball. Oh my goodness.

00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:57.870
She makes animal noises,
weird animal noises.

00:01:57.870 --> 00:01:58.703
- Wait, what?

00:01:58.703 --> 00:02:01.320
- Yes. She's so gifted at it,
too. Okay, I'll stop there.

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:02.610
I don't wanna do one.

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:05.406
- Next time I have Faith on
that will be what I ask her.

00:02:05.406 --> 00:02:06.570
Give me an animal noise.

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:07.403
- Do like (oinks)

00:02:07.403 --> 00:02:08.322
- Yeah. (laughs)

00:02:08.322 --> 00:02:09.155
- Oh, I did a little bit of it.

00:02:09.155 --> 00:02:10.478
I didn't know if that was gonna work.

00:02:10.478 --> 00:02:12.028
- [Kelly] I love it. I love it.

